{1}{Why should we build a monument in the first place? That's what I want to know! Can you give us one good reason why we should build this thing?!}{Why should we build a monument in the first place? That's what I want to know! Can you give us one good reason why we should build this thing?!}{}{}{}{}
{2}{A nice statue is an object of art and virtue for all to appreciate.}{}{10}{}{-2}{gv1014 2}
{3}{Every other town has one. You need one. It is that simple.}{}{5}{}{-2}{gv1014 0}
{4}{I don't know why. That's a question for the town council.}{}{5}{}{-2}{gv1014 1}
{5}{It is right and fitting that Ashbury should honor its heroes.}{}{13}{}{-2}{gv1014 3}
{6}{You ask why? Why indeed? For shame...I say, "why not"!}{}{10}{Ch 15}{-2}{gv1014 3}
{7}{E:}{}{-4}{}{-27}{}
{8}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{9}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{10}{There have been a lot of suggestions about where to put the monument. An improvement might be tastefully accomplished, but we are evenly split between two groups.}{There have been a lot of suggestions about where to put the monument. An improvement might be tastefully accomplished, but we are evenly split between two groups.}{}{}{}{}
{11}{Please, continue.}{}{1}{}{12}{}
{12}{The first group says that it should go in the town square. The other says it should go near the town entrance. What is your comment?}{The first group says that it should go in the town square. The other says it should go near the town entrance. What is your comment?}{}{}{}{}
{13}{They are both good choices. Build two statues! One at each!}{}{-10}{}{-10}{gv1014 1}
{14}{Don't worry about such details now. You'll figure it out later.}{}{11}{ch 13}{-10}{gv1014 3}
{15}{When I have tough decision like that, I flip a coin!}{}{-10}{}{-10}{gv1014 0}
{16}{Conduct a design contest and vote for the best design.}{}{12}{}{-10}{gv1014 3}
{17}{Could both sides agree on a third location?}{}{10}{}{-10}{gv1014 2}
{18}{Hierarchical design principles require a central location.}{}{12}{ma -25}{-10}{gv1014 3}
{19}{You must decide for yourselves. It is not my business.}{}{11}{}{-10}{gv1014 0}
